    "The desktop window manager retained a 4988x2742 GPU surface instead of the two requested window sizes. The original GPU run therefore failed viewport-size assertions. The explicit --native-window fixture passes 52 checks at the actual desktop size, and the OpenGL/Xvfb fixture passes 98 checks at confirmed 1280x960 and 2560x1440 sizes. Both use the shipped PCK.",
